exports[`templates > azure renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1478" height="632" viewBox="0 0 1478 632" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-bu1l1a768-title" aria-describedby="carto-bu1l1a768-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-bu1l1a768-title">Web shop</title><desc id="carto-bu1l1a768-desc">Azure infrastructure diagram: Production. 6 elements in 5 groups, with 5 connections.

Groups and elements
- Users
- Front Door
- Production (Subscription)
  - rg-shop-prod (Resource group)
    - vnet-shop (Virtual network)
      - snet-apps (Subnet)
        - Web shop (App Service)
        - Orders API (Container App)
      - snet-data (Subnet)
        - Orders (SQL Database)
    - Secrets (Key Vault)

Connections
- Users send traffic to Front Door over HTTPS.
- Front Door sends traffic to Web shop.
- Web shop connects to Orders API (Private network: REST).
- Orders API connects to Orders (Private network: SQL) and signs in with Secrets (secrets).

Key
- Solid sky line: Public traffic
- Dashed teal line: Private network
- Amber badge: Identity badge</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1478" height="632" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1457 12H1466V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 620H12V611" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1457 620H1466V611" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Web shop</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Production</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="460" y="0" width="938" height="433.5" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(476 15) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#806514" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.36"/><path d="M19 12v6"/><path d="M19 14h2"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r="2"/></g><text x="498" y="25.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">PRODUCTION</text><text x="586.5" y="26.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Subscription</text></g><g><rect x="480" y="44" width="898" height="369.5" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(496 59) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z"/><path d="m7 16.5-4.74-2.85"/><path d="m7 16.5 5-3"/><path d="M7 16.5v5.17"/><path d="M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z"/><path d="m17 16.5-5-3"/><path d="m17 16.5 4.74-2.85"/><path d="M17 16.5v5.17"/><path d="M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0