exports[`templates > c4 renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="369" height="649" viewBox="0 0 369 649" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-igyknd496-title" aria-describedby="carto-igyknd496-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-igyknd496-title">Web shop — system context</title><desc id="carto-igyknd496-desc">C4 model. 3 elements, with 2 connections.

Elements
- Customer (Person): Buys products online
- Web shop (Software System): Sells products and takes orders
- Payment provider (Software System, external): Charges cards

Connections
- Customer connects to Web shop (Browses and orders [HTTPS]).
- Web shop connects to Payment provider (Charges cards [REST]).

Key
- Indigo icon: Person
- Blue icon: Software system
- Icon, greyed: External system
- Solid line: Relationship</desc><defs></defs><rect width="369" height="649" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M348 12H357V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 637H12V628" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M348 637H357V628" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Web shop — system context</text><g transform="translate(40 84)"><g><path d="M120 89L120 186" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M124.5 182L120 191L115.5 182Q120 184 124.5 182Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M120 273L120 362" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M124.5 358L120 367L115.5 358Q120 360 124.5 358Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><title>Buys products online</title><rect x="4" y="7" width="232" height="82" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(22 25) scale(0.9166666666666666)" fill="none" stroke="#40429B" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="5"/><path d="M20 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"/></g><text x="62" y="32.9" font-size="13.5" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Customer</text><text x="62" y="49.6" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">[Person]</text><text x="17" y="73.6" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Buys products online</text></g><g><title>Sells products and takes orders</title><rect x="4" y="191" width="232" height="82" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(22 209) scale(0.9166666666666666)" fill="none" stroke="#2B62A3" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path