"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="842" height="414" viewBox="0 0 842 414" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-6vfoee540-title" aria-describedby="carto-6vfoee540-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-6vfoee540-title">Business capability map</title><desc id="carto-6vfoee540-desc">Capability map: Maturity per capability, 2026 baseline. 4 areas and 10 capabilities.

Areas and capabilities
- Customer
  - Marketing (3)
  - Sales (4)
  - Service (2)
- Products
  - Product management (3)
  - Pricing (2)
- Operations
  - Order management (4)
  - Fulfilment (3)
  - Procurement (2)
- Finance
  - Accounting (5)
  - Planning (3)

Key
- Shade 1 of 5 (lightest): Maturity: 1 Initial
- Shade 2 of 5: 2 Developing
- Shade 3 of 5: 3 Defined
- Shade 4 of 5: 4 Managed
