exports[`templates > class renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="524" height="1124" viewBox="0 0 524 1124" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1tinvcm1129-title" aria-describedby="carto-1tinvcm1129-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1tinvcm1129-title">Order aggregate</title><desc id="carto-1tinvcm1129-desc">Class diagram: Ordering context, domain layer. 5 classes, with 4 relations.

Classes
- Order (aggregate root)
  - id (OrderId, private)
  - status (OrderStatus, private)
  - placedAt (Instant, private)
  - addLine(product: ProductId, quantity: Int) (void, public)
  - place() (void, public)
  - total() (Money, public)
- OrderLine (entity)
  - product (ProductId, private)
  - quantity (Int, private)
  - subtotal() (Money, public)
- Money (record» «value object)
  - amount (Decimal, public)
  - currency (Currency, public)
  - add(other: Money) (Money, public)
- OrderStatus (enumeration)
  - Draft
  - Placed
  - Paid
  - Shipped
  - Cancelled
- OrderRepository (interface)
  - byId(id: OrderId) (Order, public)
  - save(order: Order) (void, public)

Relations
- Order (1) is made of OrderLine (lines 1..*).
- Order is associated with OrderStatus.
- OrderLine is associated with Money (price).
- OrderRepository depends on Order &quot;stores&quot;.

Key
- Solid line ending in a filled diamond: Composed of (owns)
- Solid line ending in an open arrowhead: Association
- Dashed line ending in an open arrowhead: Depends on</desc><defs></defs><rect width="524" height="1124" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M503 12H512V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 1112H12V1103" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M503 1112H512V1103" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Order aggregate</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Ordering context, domain layer</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><path d="M180 414.5L180 513" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M180 414.5L174.5 422.5L180 430.5L185.5 422.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="miter" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g><path d="M204 414.5L204 465Q204 473 212 473L336 473Q344 473 344 481L344 513" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M350 503L344 513L338 503" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g><path d="M112 652L112 786.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M118 776.5L112 786.5L106 776.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g><path d="M192 110L192 209.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/><path d="M198 199.5L192 209.5L186 199.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><g><rect x="8" y="209.5" width="368" height="205" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M8.5 267.5V215.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 14 210H370A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 375.5 2