exports[`templates > cloud renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1670" height="919" viewBox="0 0 1670 919" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1b8pwke1714-title" aria-describedby="carto-1b8pwke1714-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1b8pwke1714-title">Web shop on AWS</title><desc id="carto-1b8pwke1714-desc">AWS and Google Cloud diagram: Production, three availability zones. 9 elements in 12 groups, with 10 connections.

Groups and elements
- Users
- CDN and WAF (CloudFront)
- shop-prod (123456789012)
  - eu-west-1 (Region)
    - vpc-shop (VPC · 10.0.0.0/16)
      - Load balancer (Application Load Balancer · public)
      - eu-west-1a (Availability zone)
        - Private subnet (10.0.10.0/24)
          - Web shop (ECS service · 2 tasks)
        - Isolated subnet (10.0.20.0/24)
          - Orders (reader) (Aurora cluster)
      - eu-west-1b (Availability zone)
        - Private subnet (10.0.11.0/24)
          - Web shop (ECS service · 2 tasks)
        - Isolated subnet (10.0.21.0/24)
          - Orders (writer) (Aurora cluster)
      - eu-west-1c (Availability zone)
        - Private subnet (10.0.12.0/24)
          - Web shop (ECS service · 2 tasks)
        - Isolated subnet (10.0.22.0/24)
          - Orders (reader) (Aurora cluster)

Connections
- Users send traffic to CDN and WAF over HTTPS.
- CDN and WAF sends traffic to Load balancer.
- Load balancer connects to Web shop (ECS service) (Private network), connects to Web shop (ECS service) (Private network) and connects to Web shop (ECS service) (Private network).
- Web shop (ECS service) connects to Orders (writer) (Private network).
- Web shop (ECS service) connects to Orders (writer) (Private network: SQL).
- Web shop (ECS service) connects to Orders (writer) (Private network).
- Orders (writer) sends data to Orders (reader) (Aurora cluster) and sends data to Orders (reader) (Aurora cluster) (replication).

Key
- Solid sky line: Public traffic
- Dashed teal line: Private network
- Solid violet line with ticks: Data flow</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1670" height="919" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1649 12H1658V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 907H12V898" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1649 907H1658V898" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Web shop on AWS</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Production, three availability zones</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="248.2" y="6" width="1341.7" height="715" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(264.2 21) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#806514" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 20H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3.9a2 2 0 0 1 1.69.9l.81 1.2a2 2 0 0 0 1.67.9H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1.36"/><path d="M19 12v6"/><path d="M19 14h2"/><circle cx="19" cy="20" r="2"/></g><text x="286.2" y="31.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">SHOP-PROD</text><text x="367.4" y="32.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">123456789012</text></g><g><rect x="268.2" y="62" width="1301.7" height="639" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(284.2 77) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54"/><path d="M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17"/><path d="M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></g><text x="306.2" y="87.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">EU-WEST-1</text><text x="378.5" y="88.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Region</text></g><g><rect x="288.2" y="118" width="1261.7" height="563" rx="8" fill="#E8E4D8" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(304.2 133) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#1E7495" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m10.586 5.414-5.172 5.172"/><path d="m18.586 13.414-5.172 5.172"/><path d="M6 12h12"/><circle cx="12" cy="20" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="4" r="2"/><circle cx="20" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="4" cy="12" r="2"/></g><text x="326.2" y="143.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">VPC-SHOP</text><text x="398.7" y="144.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">VPC · 10.0.0.0/16</text></g><g><rect x="308.2" y="259" width="325.8" height="402" rx="8" fill="#E8E4D8" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(324.2 274) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></g><text x="346.2" y="284.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">EU-WEST-1A</text><text x="427" y="285.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Availability zone</text></g><g><rect x="670.3" y="259" width="378.7" height="402" rx="8" fill="#E8E4D8" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(686.3 274) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></g><text x="708.3" y="284.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">EU-WEST-1B</text><text x="788.2" y="285.1" font-size="11.