exports[`templates > data-products renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1217" height="655" viewBox="0 0 1217 655" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-12at2ra943-title" aria-describedby="carto-12at2ra943-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-12at2ra943-title">Customer data products</title><desc id="carto-12at2ra943-desc">Data products diagram: From operational systems to fit-for-purpose products. 8 elements in 3 groups, with 8 connections.

Groups and elements
- Sales (Domain · Sales engineering)
  - Webshop (Source · Application)
  - orders (Source-aligned)
- Customer (Domain · CRM team)
  - Customer 360 (Aggregate)
  - Salesforce (Source · SaaS)
  - customers (Source-aligned)
- Sales dashboard (Dashboard)
- Marketing (Domain)
  - Churn risk (Consumer-aligned)
- Campaign tool (Application)

Connections
- Webshop connects to orders (CDC).
- orders connects to Customer 360 and connects to Sales dashboard.
- Customer 360 connects to Sales dashboard and connects to Churn risk.
- Churn risk connects to Campaign tool.
- Salesforce connects to customers (daily).
- customers connects to Customer 360.

Key
- Teal filled pill: Source-aligned
- Indigo filled pill: Aggregate
- Amber filled pill: Consumer-aligned
- Solid line: Data flow</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1217" height="655" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1196 12H1205V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 643H12V634" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1196 643H1205V634" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Customer data products</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">From operational systems to fit-for-purpose products</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="3.3" y="11" width="275.7" height="286" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(19.3 26) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h4c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/><path d="M10 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2v-4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h4c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/><rect width="8" height="8" x="14" y="14" rx="2"/></g><text x="41.3" y="36.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">SALES</text><text x="87.7" y="37.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Domain · Sales engineering</text></g><g><rect x="285.5" y="11" width="283.4" height="446" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/><g transform="translate(301.5 26) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 10c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h4c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/><path d="M10 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2v-4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h4c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/><rect width="8" height="8" x="14" y="14" rx="2"/></g><text x="323.5" y="36.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">CUSTOMER</text><text x="398.7" y="37.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F