exports[`templates > erd renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="946" height="512" viewBox="0 0 946 512" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-edcjm91146-title" aria-describedby="carto-edcjm91146-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-edcjm91146-title">Orders</title><desc id="carto-edcjm91146-desc">Database design. 4 tables, with 3 relations.

Tables
- customers
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - email (text, unique)
  - name (text)
- orders
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - customer_id (uuid, foreign key to customers.id)
  - placed_at (timestamptz)
  - total (numeric(10,2))
- order_lines
  - order_id (uuid, primary key, foreign key to orders.id)
  - product_id (uuid, primary key, foreign key to products.id)
  - quantity (int)
- products
  - id (uuid, primary key)
  - name (text)
  - price (numeric(10,2))

Relations
- orders.customer_id → customers.id: each orders row has exactly one customers row; each customers row has zero or many orders rows.
- order_lines.order_id → orders.id: each order_lines row has exactly one orders row; each orders row has zero or many order_lines rows.
- order_lines.product_id → products.id: each order_lines row has exactly one products row; each products row has zero or many order_lines rows.

Key
- Amber key symbol: Primary key
- Blue link symbol: Foreign key
- Violet fingerprint symbol: Unique
- Solid line ending in a bar: Exactly one
- Solid line ending in a ring and crow's foot: Zero or many</desc><defs></defs><rect width="946" height="512" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M925 12H934V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 500H12V491" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M925 500H934V491" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Orders</text><g transform="translate(40 84)"><g><path d="M544 86.5L666 86.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M658 80.5L658 92.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M653 80.5L653 92.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M556 86.5L544 93.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M556 86.5L544 79.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M556 86.5L544 86.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="564" cy="86.5" r="4" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3"/></g><g><path d="M200 165.5L271 165.5Q279 165.5 279 157.5L279 66.5Q279 58.5 287 58.5L322 58.5" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M314 52.5L314 64.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M309 52.5L309 64.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M212 165.5L200 172.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M212 165.5L200 158.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M212 165.5L200 165.5" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><circle cx="220" cy="165.5" r="4"