exports[`templates > gitflow renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1091" height="552" viewBox="0 0 1091 552" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-4oc9o61159-title" aria-describedby="carto-4oc9o61159-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-4oc9o61159-title">Our branching strategy</title><desc id="carto-4oc9o61159-desc">Git branching diagram. 7 branches and 19 commits.

Branches
- main (long-lived, 3 commits)
- hotfix/1.1.1 (hotfix, 1 commit)
- release/1.1 (release, 2 commits)
- develop (long-lived, 8 commits)
- feature/login (feature, 2 commits)
- feature/search (feature, 2 commits)
- feature/export (feature, 1 commit)

History
Oldest first.
1. main: Initial release, tagged v1.0.0.
2. develop: Set up CI, branches off main.
3. feature/login: Login form, branches off develop.
4. develop: Update deps.
5. feature/search: Search index, branches off develop.
6. feature/login: Validation, PR review.
7. develop: merges feature/login, Deploy to test.
8. feature/search: Search UI.
9. release/1.1: Bump to 1.1.0, branches off develop, Deploy to staging.
10. develop: merges feature/search.
11. release/1.1: Fix typo.
12. main: merges release/1.1, tagged v1.1.0.
13. develop: merges release/1.1.
14. hotfix/1.1.1: Fix crash, branches off main.
15. main: merges hotfix/1.1.1, tagged v1.1.1.
16. develop: merges hotfix/1.1.1.
17. develop: Next sprint.
18. feature/export: Export CSV, branches off develop.
19. develop: merges feature/export, Deploy to test.</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1091" height="552" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1070 12H1079V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 540H12V531" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1070 540H1079V531" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Our branching strategy</text><g transform="translate(40 84)"><g><g transform="translate(0 0)"><path d="M132 57.5H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 103.5H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 163H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 265H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 311H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 394.5H1003" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="2 5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M187 57.5H1002.5" stroke="#2B62A3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M1008.5 57.5H1010.5M1016.5 57.5H1017.5" stroke="#2B62A3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/><path d="M728 103.5H728" stroke="#9B2834" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M539 163H637" stroke="#806514" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M220 265H1002.5" stroke="#7655C1" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M1008.5 265H1010.5M1016.5 265H1017.5" stroke="#7655C1" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/><path d="M249 311H355" stroke="#2A6B5C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M329 394.5H467" stroke="#2A6B5C" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M866 311H86