exports[`templates > github renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1507" height="763" viewBox="0 0 1507 763" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1pldfsv1074-title" aria-describedby="carto-1pldfsv1074-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1pldfsv1074-title">GitHub setup</title><desc id="carto-1pldfsv1074-desc">GitHub design: Teams, repositories and deployments. 9 elements in 3 groups, with 7 connections.

Groups and elements
- acme (Organisation)
  - Developers (Team)
  - acme/shop (Repository)
    - main protected (1 review · status checks)
    - ci.yml (on pull request)
    - deploy.yml (on push to main)
    - staging (Environment)
    - production (required reviewers)
  - Platform (Team)
- ubuntu-latest (GitHub-hosted runner)
- Azure (Cloud)
  - Container Apps (Deployment target)

Connections
- Developers connects to acme/shop (Repository access: write).
- Platform connects to acme/shop (Repository access: admin).
- main protected connects to ci.yml (Protects: required check).
- ci.yml depends on ubuntu-latest (runs on).
- deploy.yml connects to staging (Deploys) and connects to production (Deploys).
- production connects to Container Apps (OIDC federation: OIDC).

Key
- Solid indigo line: Repository access
- Solid amber line, double: Deploys
- Dotted line: Uses
- Dotted violet line with beads: OIDC federation
- Dashed rose line with ticks: Protects</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1507" height="763" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1486 12H1495V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 751H12V742" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1486 751H1495V742" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">GitHub setup</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Teams, repositories and deployments</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="2" y="7" width="811" height="558" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(18 22) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#4E5A65" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 10h.01"/><path d="M12 14h.01"/><path d="M12 6h.01"/><path d="M16 10h.01"/><path d="M16 14h.01"/><path d="M16 6h.01"/><path d="M8 10h.01"/><path d="M8 14h.01"/><path d="M8 6h.01"/><path d="M9 22v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"/><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20" rx="2"/></g><text x="40" y="32.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">ACME</text><text x="83.1" y="33.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Organisation</text></g><g><rect x="1213" y="327" width="214" height="122" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><g transform="translate(1229 342) scale(0.5833333333333334)" fill="none" stroke="#1E7495" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"/></g><text x="1251" y="352.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">AZURE</text><text x="1299" y="353.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Cloud</text></g><g><rect x="22" y="231" width="771" height="314" rx="8" fill="#F0EDE4" str