exports[`templates > matrix renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="974" height="662" viewBox="0 0 974 662" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-mj673k1494-title" aria-describedby="carto-mj673k1494-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-mj673k1494-title">Platform migration — RACI</title><desc id="carto-mj673k1494-desc">Matrix: Who does what in the move to the new platform. A table of 7 rows by 6 columns.

By row (Activity by role)
Columns: Business (Sponsor, Programme manager); IT (Architect, Platform team, App teams); Risk (Security officer).
- Prepare
  - Business case: Sponsor: A (Accountable); Programme manager: R (Responsible); Architect: C (Consulted); Security officer: I (Informed)
  - Migration plan: Sponsor: I (Informed); Programme manager: A (Accountable); Architect: R (Responsible); Platform team: C (Consulted); App teams: C (Consulted); Security officer: C (Consulted)
- Build
  - Landing zone: Programme manager: I (Informed); Architect: A (Accountable); Platform team: R (Responsible); Security officer: C (Consulted)
  - Deployment pipelines: Architect: C (Consulted); Platform team: A (Accountable), R (Responsible); App teams: C (Consulted)
- Migrate
  - Move the applications: Programme manager: A (Accountable); Platform team: C (Consulted); App teams: R (Responsible); Security officer: I (Informed)
  - Acceptance tests: Programme manager: A (Accountable); App teams: R (Responsible); Security officer: C (Consulted)
- Run
  - Cut-over and decommission: Sponsor: I (Informed); Programme manager: A (Accountable); Platform team: R (Responsible); App teams: R (Responsible); Security officer: I (Informed)

Key
- Tag R: Responsible: does the work
- Tag A: Accountable: signs off, one per activity
- Tag C: Consulted: asked before
- Tag I: Informed: told after</desc><defs></defs><rect width="974" height="662" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M953 12H962V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 650H12V641" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M953 650H962V641" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Platform migration — RACI</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">Who does what in the move to the new platform</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="2" y="0" width="892" height="464" rx="6" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M2.5 82V6Q2.5 0.5 8 0.5H888Q893.5 0.5 893.5 6V82Z" fill="#F8F6F1"/><line x1="2" y1="82" x2="894" y2="82" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><text x="322.4" y="20.6" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle">BUSINESS</text><line x1="202" y1="28" x2="442.8" y2="28" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-opacity="0.6" stroke-width="1"/><text x="611.6" y="20.6" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle">IT</text><line x1="458.8" y1="28" x2="764.3" y2="28" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-opacity="0.6" stroke-width="1"/><text x="833.2" y="20.6" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle">RISK</text><line x1="780.3" y1="28" x2="886.1" y2="28" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-opacity="0.6" stroke-width="1"/><text x="18" y="58.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="500" fill="#5D6670">Activity \\ role</text><text x="222.1" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Sponsor</text><text x="246" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">1 A · 2 I</text><line x1="194" y1="36" x2="194" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="314" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Programme manager</text><text x="374.4" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">1 R · 4 A · 1 I</text><line x1="298" y1="36" x2="298" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="476.1" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Architect</text><text x="502.8" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">1 R · 1 A · 2 C</text><line x1="450.8" y1="36" x2="450.8" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="570.8" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Platform team</text><text x="611.6" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">3 R · 1 A · 2 C</text><line x1="554.8" y1="36" x2="554.8" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="689.6" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">App teams</text><text x="720.3" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">3 R · 2 C</text><line x1="668.3" y1="36" x2="668.3" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><text x="788.3" y="51.3" font-size="12" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Security officer</text><text x="833.2" y="67.1" font-size="11.5" font-weight="400" fill="#5D6670" text-anchor="middle">3 C · 3 I</text><line x1="772.3" y1="36" x2="772.3" y2="464" stroke="#99948A" stroke-opacity="0.5" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="2.5" y="82.5" width="891" height="27" fill="#F0EDE4" fill-opacity="0.6"/><text x="18" y="99.6" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66">PREPARE</text><line x1="2" y1="186" x2="894" y2="186" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="2.5" y="186.5" width="891" height="27" fill="#F0EDE4" fill-opacity="0.6"/><text x="18" y="203.6" font-size="10" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66">BUILD</text><line x1="2" y1="290" x2="894" y2="290" stroke="#99948A" stroke-width="1"/><rect x="2.5" y="290.5" width="891" height="27" fill="#F0EDE4" 