exports[`templates > process renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1111" height="522" viewBox="0 0 1111 522" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1fke3qa911-title" aria-describedby="carto-1fke3qa911-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1fke3qa911-title">Access request</title><desc id="carto-1fke3qa911-desc">Process diagram: From request to access, approved by the line manager. 9 elements in 3 lanes, with 8 connections.

Lanes and steps
- Employee (lane)
  - Start event
  - Request access
  - Confirm access
  - End event
- Line manager (lane)
  - Check request
  - Approved? (decision decision)
  - Explain why
  - Request rejected (end event)
- IT service desk (lane)
  - Grant access

Main path
1. Start event
2. Request access
3. Check request
4. Approved?
5. Grant access: Approved? yes
6. Confirm access
7. End event

Connections
- Start event leads to Request access.
- Request access leads to Check request.
- Check request leads to Approved?
- Approved? leads to Grant access (yes) and leads to Explain why (no).
- Grant access leads to Confirm access.
- Explain why leads to Request rejected.
- Confirm access leads to End event.

Key
- Solid line, thick: Happy path
- Solid line: Other paths</desc><defs></defs><rect width="1111" height="522" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1090 12H1099V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 510H12V501" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1090 510H1099V501" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Access request</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">From request to access, approved by the line manager</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="0" y="0" width="1031" height="86" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M130 1L130 85" fill="none" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="65" y="46.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">EMPLOYEE</text></g><g><rect x="0" y="94" width="1031" height="136" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M130 95L130 229" fill="none" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="65" y="165.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">LINE MANAGER</text></g><g><rect x="0" y="238" width="1031" height="86" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M130 239L130 323" fill="none" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><text x="65" y="284.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" text-anchor="middle" letter-spacing="1">IT SERVICE DESK</text></g><g><path d="M182 43L213 43" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="3.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><p