exports[`templates > roadmap renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1422" height="500" viewBox="0 0 1422 500" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-oaj936506-title" aria-describedby="carto-oaj936506-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-oaj936506-title">Platform roadmap 2026</title><desc id="carto-oaj936506-desc">Roadmap &amp; timeline. 4 items and 1 milestone in 3 lanes, Jan to Dec 2026.

By lane
- Platform
  - Landing zone: 1 Jan to 28 Feb 2026, done
  - AKS baseline: 1 Mar to 9 May 2026, in progress, after Landing zone
- Data
  - Lakehouse: 1 Mar to 31 Jul 2026, planned
- Applications
  - Move web shop: 10 May to 9 Aug 2026, at risk, after AKS baseline
- Go-live: milestone on 1 Oct 2026

Phases
- Wave 1: 1 Jan to 30 Apr 2026
- Wave 2: 1 May to 30 Sep 2026

Today
