exports[`templates > states renders without problems 1`] = `
"<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="707" height="670" viewBox="0 0 707 670" font-family="'Instrument Sans', Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" role="img" aria-labelledby="carto-1viwlwy965-title" aria-describedby="carto-1viwlwy965-desc" lang="en" xml:lang="en"><title id="carto-1viwlwy965-title">Order lifecycle</title><desc id="carto-1viwlwy965-desc">States diagram: The states an order can be in, and what moves it on. 9 states in 1 group, with 10 transitions.

Groups and elements
- Start
- Awaiting payment: entry / reserve stock
- Fulfilment
  - Start of Fulfilment
  - Picking: do / collect the items
  - Packed: entry / print the label
- Cancelled: entry / release stock
- Shipped
- End
- Delivered

Main path
1. Start
2. Awaiting payment: order placed
3. Picking: payment received
4. Shipped: handed to carrier
5. Delivered: signed for
6. End

Transitions
- Start moves to Awaiting payment on order placed.
- Awaiting payment moves to Fulfilment on payment received and moves to Cancelled on 30 min without payment.
- Fulfilment moves to Cancelled on customer cancels and moves to Shipped on handed to carrier.
- Cancelled moves to End.
- Shipped moves to Delivered on signed for.
- Delivered moves to End.
- Start of Fulfilment moves to Picking.
- Picking moves to Packed on all items scanned.</desc><defs></defs><rect width="707" height="670" fill="#FFFFFF"/><g data-sheet=""><path d="M21 12H12V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M686 12H695V21" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M21 658H12V649" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M686 658H695V649" fill="none" stroke="#5D6670" stroke-width="1"/></g><text x="40" y="56" font-size="20" font-weight="600" fill="#16212C">Order lifecycle</text><text x="40" y="80" font-size="13" font-weight="400" fill="#4F5B66">The states an order can be in, and what moves it on</text><g transform="translate(40 104)"><g><rect x="14" y="153" width="613" height="134" rx="8" fill="#F8F6F1" stroke="#9A9485" stroke-width="1"/><text x="52" y="178.8" font-size="10.5" font-weight="600" fill="#4F5B66" letter-spacing="1">FULFILMENT</text></g><g><path d="M33 40L161 40" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M157 35.5L166 40L157 44.5Q159 40 157 35.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M252 75L252 148" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M256.5 144L252 153L247.5 144Q252 146 256.5 144Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M52 232L147 232" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M143 227.5L152 232L143 236.5Q145 232 143 227.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M296 232L460 232" fill="none" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M456 227.5L465 232L456 236.5Q458 232 456 227.5Z" fill="#5E6A75" stroke="#5E6A75" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/></g><g><path d="M332.5 287L332.5 441Q332.5 449 324.5 449L200 449Q192 449 19